exports[`email templates > first_report renders in en 1`] = `
{
  "subject": "Your first report: share it with your team",
  "text": "Share your first report

Reports help most when the people who own the assistant read them. Invite your team to the workspace, or create a private link to the report.

Share the report:
https://app.caudals.com/workspace/reports?orgId=00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

Want us to walk your team through the results? Book a readout: we present the findings and what to fix first.

Book a readout:
https://cal.com/caudals/call

The Caudals team

--
A few emails to help you get started with Caudals. They stop once your workspace is set up.
Unsubscribe from these emails: https://app.caudals.com/workspace/unsubscribe#aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
Caudals · caudals.com
",
}
`;

