exports[`email templates > welcome renders in en 1`] = `
{
  "subject": "Welcome to Caudals",
  "text": "Welcome, Ana

Your workspace Acme is ready. Your first report is three steps away:

1. Connect your assistant: the chat on your website, an API or answers you import.
2. Add your documentation. Caudals drafts a test set from it for you to review.
3. Run the test and read the report: what fails, why, and what fixes it.

Open your workspace:
https://app.caudals.com/workspace/evaluations?orgId=00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

Questions? Write to hello@caudals.com.

The Caudals team

--
A few emails to help you get started with Caudals. They stop once your workspace is set up.
Unsubscribe from these emails: https://app.caudals.com/workspace/unsubscribe#aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
Caudals · caudals.com
",
}
`;

